830
00:40:17,181 --> 00:40:17,982
[SPEAKER_01]: I liked to watch it.

831
00:40:22,244 --> 00:40:24,086
[SPEAKER_01]: They used to say, well, he can't hit.

832
00:40:24,126 --> 00:40:25,847
[SPEAKER_01]: What are they putting him on?

833
00:40:26,288 --> 00:40:28,870
[SPEAKER_01]: I said, what are you telling me that for?

834
00:40:28,930 --> 00:40:30,351
[SPEAKER_01]: They didn't know who I was.

835
00:40:30,611 --> 00:40:32,693
[SPEAKER_01]: I don't get along.

836
00:40:33,353 --> 00:40:35,815
[SPEAKER_01]: So one time I said, I bet he's going to hit.

837
00:40:37,296 --> 00:40:39,638
[SPEAKER_01]: Not knowing no more than the man in the room.

838
00:40:40,279 --> 00:40:42,320
[SPEAKER_01]: So luck he hit.

839
00:40:42,500 --> 00:40:44,922
[SPEAKER_01]: So I did that guy one push in the back.

840
00:40:45,283 --> 00:40:47,244
[SPEAKER_01]: I said, what did you say about that guy?

841
00:40:48,698 --> 00:40:51,219
[SPEAKER_01]: So he says to me, you must have had a bet on him.

842
00:40:51,339 --> 00:40:53,699
[SPEAKER_01]: I says, I sure did.

843
00:40:56,840 --> 00:41:01,542
[SPEAKER_01]: See, we had our own seats, but he used to always like to go someplace else.

844
00:41:02,682 --> 00:41:05,223
[SPEAKER_01]: I'd learn more, you know, here.

845
00:41:10,064 --> 00:41:11,084
[SPEAKER_01]: Did the boys like it?

