857
00:41:41,941 --> 00:41:42,321
[SPEAKER_03]: Oh, dear.

858
00:41:44,112 --> 00:41:48,134
[SPEAKER_03]: That was a bad time of year to get away, probably, wasn't it?

859
00:41:48,174 --> 00:41:48,594
[SPEAKER_01]: Sure.

860
00:41:50,675 --> 00:41:53,296
[SPEAKER_03]: How'd you feel about that World Series, winning all those games?

861
00:41:53,896 --> 00:41:56,658
[SPEAKER_02]: It didn't bother me.

862
00:41:56,758 --> 00:42:01,760
[SPEAKER_02]: I just said to myself, if he gets me a few runs, I'll give him a bad one.

863
00:42:02,240 --> 00:42:04,341
