00:42:05,782 --> 00:42:06,942
[SPEAKER_03]: We had Bagby over there.

865
00:42:09,478 --> 00:42:10,279
[SPEAKER_03]: Wasn't there anybody else?

866
00:42:10,519 --> 00:42:11,119
[SPEAKER_03]: Males?

867
00:42:11,139 --> 00:42:14,181
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, males, he'd come in on the coast.

868
00:42:14,221 --> 00:42:15,502
[SPEAKER_02]: He'd come in on the coast.

869
00:42:15,982 --> 00:42:17,563
[SPEAKER_03]: What did the speaker say to you?

870
00:42:18,064 --> 00:42:20,645
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, it was the second game.

871
00:42:20,685 --> 00:42:23,727
[SPEAKER_02]: He says, I'm working you today.

872
00:42:23,807 --> 00:42:26,569
[SPEAKER_02]: And I said, it looks like I'm going to have two days rest.

873
00:42:26,589 --> 00:42:28,730
