875
00:42:35,135 --> 00:42:36,355
[SPEAKER_02]: It made no difference to me.

876
00:42:38,567 --> 00:42:42,168
[SPEAKER_02]: I don't know why it is, but I didn't have to warn them much.

877
00:42:43,908 --> 00:42:48,349
[SPEAKER_02]: I bet you if I had 5, 6, 8, 10 balls, you might be warned.

878
00:42:48,829 --> 00:42:50,570
[SPEAKER_02]: But I never cut into the ball.

879
00:42:52,290 --> 00:42:52,890
[SPEAKER_02]: You know what I mean?

880
00:42:52,990 --> 00:42:58,871
[SPEAKER_02]: I never forced myself throwing them in there, unless I had to.

881
00:42:59,151 --> 00:43:02,292
[SPEAKER_01]: Tell them about the 19 innings you pitched one time.

882
00:43:02,572 --> 00:43:03,392
[SPEAKER_02]: Oh, yeah.

883
00:43:03,492 --> 00:43:04,813
[SPEAKER_02]: I pitched 19 in New York one time.

884
00:43:07,096 --> 00:43:09,016
[SPEAKER_02]: Up to the 8th in, there were 9 hits off me.

885
00:43:10,157 --> 00:43:14,298
[SPEAKER_02]: And from the 9th in to the 19th, I think I had only 3 hits.

886
00:43:14,438 --> 00:43:15,918
