893
00:43:26,460 --> 00:43:27,721
[SPEAKER_02]: I pitched the whole 19 in.

894
00:43:28,181 --> 00:43:34,402
[SPEAKER_03]: I was looking through the record, you've pitched about a few hundred complete games.

895
00:43:36,080 --> 00:43:39,642
