900
00:43:58,413 --> 00:44:01,094
[SPEAKER_02]: And that game was played less than an hour.

901
00:44:01,395 --> 00:44:01,835
[SPEAKER_03]: Is that right?

902
00:44:01,915 --> 00:44:04,296
[SPEAKER_03]: A nine inning game?

903
00:44:04,396 --> 00:44:05,597
[SPEAKER_02]: Nine inning game, yeah.

904
00:44:06,226 --> 00:44:11,391
