01:05:39,054 --> 01:05:40,314
[SPEAKER_03]: Is that right?

1298
01:05:40,374 --> 01:05:43,695
[SPEAKER_01]: In the winter, he'd melt in twice, I think.

1299
01:05:45,266 --> 01:05:48,489
[SPEAKER_02]: Did you play any other sports either in school or

1300
01:06:14,221 --> 01:06:15,622
[SPEAKER_03]: How much schooling did you have?

1301
01:06:16,222 --> 01:06:19,444
[SPEAKER_02]: I went to work in the breakers when I was four years old.

1302
01:06:19,644 --> 01:06:22,186
[SPEAKER_03]: And you went to school up to that time?

1303
01:06:24,847 --> 01:06:40,315
[SPEAKER_02]: I went to work in the breakers when I was four years old.

1304
01:06:40,535 --> 01:06:43,097
[SPEAKER_03]: And you went to school up to that time?

1305
01:06:45,733 --> 01:06:52,775
[SPEAKER_02]: I put in kindergarten the first year, and he put me in second grade, and the same year he put me back in first grade.

1306
01:06:52,795 --> 01:06:54,015
[SPEAKER_02]: I was too small.

