[SPEAKER_03]: Yeah, I kicked it over.

1310
01:07:00,136 --> 01:07:01,436
[SPEAKER_03]: Boy, I almost did.

1311
01:07:01,536 --> 01:07:04,457
[SPEAKER_03]: That would be you, wouldn't it?

1312
01:07:04,477 --> 01:07:08,098
Yeah, all right.

1313
