1329
01:07:42,020 --> 01:07:43,400
[SPEAKER_00]: I don't know about that, but I know.

1330
01:07:43,855 --> 01:07:47,756
[SPEAKER_00]: Because actually, although my husband teaches in Ohio, we live in West Virginia.

1331
01:07:48,416 --> 01:07:49,616
[SPEAKER_00]: We live across the river.

1332
