[SPEAKER_00]: So I mean, you know, you hear a lot about the black lung disease over there.

1333
01:07:54,877 --> 01:07:58,237
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, it's a wonder I haven't got it.

1334
01:07:58,297 --> 01:07:59,678
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah, but all the dust.

1335
01:07:59,818 --> 01:08:01,598
[SPEAKER_00]: I left it back to you, too.

1336
