[SPEAKER_02]: Oh, I guess one inch.

1341
01:08:17,409 --> 01:08:18,829
[SPEAKER_03]: Were you able to save much?

1342
01:08:18,969 --> 01:08:23,652
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, you couldn't save too much, but you could save some of it.

1343
01:08:24,152 --> 01:08:28,815
